Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.07,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}So don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:56.62,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに知らないように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.66,0:24:01.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたを守れますように
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.92,0:24:07.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}The story has only just begun
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.59,0:24:10.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あてのない
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:14.68,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}道なき道にいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:19.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}迷いながらいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:27.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望が　そこにあるよ　ともにあるよ
Dialogue: 1,0:24:27.61,0:24:30.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:32.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どこにいでも行ける羽を
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.16,0:24:34.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.91,0:24:36.41,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに授けたの
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:43.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どんな闇も晴らしてしまえるように
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:47.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}You gave me holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:52.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}恐れず進めよ　Oh holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.13,0:24:56.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}振り返ればいつも　Holy trace
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:25:00.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたが笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.69,0:25:05.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}だから　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.73,0:25:10.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躓きながらでも　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.23,0:25:14.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}私は踏み出せる　遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.61,0:25:19.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}あなたがいる場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.07,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以不要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:56.62,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}愿不会被你察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.66,0:24:01.50,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}愿默默守护着你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.92,0:24:07.46,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}故事才刚刚拉开序幕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.59,0:24:10.22,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}纵使是在望不到尽头的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:14.68,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}举步维艰时也请相信
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:19.64,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}踌躇不定时也请相信
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:27.40,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望就在那里 与我们相伴
Dialogue: 1,0:24:27.61,0:24:30.11,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:32.49,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}将能飞向万千世界的羽翼
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.16,0:24:34.74,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.91,0:24:36.41,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}授予你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:43.37,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}愿它能助你划破一切黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:47.55,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}你赐予了我神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:52.13,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}让我不惧一切地前行 神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.13,0:24:56.47,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}每当回首都是条 光明之路
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:25:00.60,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}都有你的笑容相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.69,0:25:05.73,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以 神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.73,0:25:10.23,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}即便是几经坎坷 神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.23,0:25:14.61,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}我都会迈向远方
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.61,0:25:19.16,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}向着有你在的方向
